[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0000","text":"造型师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0010","text":"羽那觉得呢？\n刚才看的那套衣服和这套，哪个好？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0020","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0030","text":"你觉得哪个好呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0001","text":"造型师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0040","text":"所以说嘛，两套都绝对适合你啦～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0050","text":"诶？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0002","text":"造型师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0060","text":"不过话说回来──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0070","text":"……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0003","text":"造型师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0080","text":"虽然说到CoMETIK就是黑色，\n但个人来说，我觉得羽那适合白色"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0090","text":"真的呐（诶嘿嘿）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0004","text":"造型师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0100","text":"嘛，总之多试试看吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0005","text":"造型师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0110","text":"我会让你试很多套衣服的，\n你就当个换装人偶吧，加油哦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0120","text":"呵呵，好──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0121","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0130","text":"──这是给路加的信"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0140","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0150","text":"路加，下周末的会议──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0160","text":"我知道"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0170","text":"……不用你一件件提醒"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0180","text":"……不，你说得对！\n抱歉，我有点太操心了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0181","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0190","text":"……谢谢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_03_0200","text":"…………"}]
